ed day's data.\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"title\": \"Your statistics 📊\",\n        \"body\": \"In Statistics you see gross/net charts, top markets, top suppliers, pie charts and many other useful insights.\"\n      },\n      \"buongiorno\": {\n        \"title\": \"The «Good Morning» AI 🤖\",\n        \"body\": \"Every morning open Good Morning to get the REAL WEATHER of the day and the GAS STATION with the BEST PRICE along your route to the market. Plus: upcoming deadlines, top markets and personalized tips based on YOUR data.\"\n      },\n      \"carburante_setup\": {\n        \"title\": \"Fuel consumption ⛽\",\n        \"body\": \"In Settings → FUEL enter NOW an example: last refuel (liters & euros). The app will use this to automatically calculate how much each market costs based on km driven.\"\n      },\n      \"notes_setup\": {\n        \"title\": \"NOTES section 📝\",\n        \"body\": \"Here you write appointments, orders to suppliers, deadlines, ideas. Add NOW an appointment (e.g. \\\"Accountant Tuesday 10:00\\\"). You'll find it both in the Home calendar and in the 🔔 notifications bell.\"\n      },\n      \"backup_info\": {\n        \"title\": \"Data backup 💾\",\n        \"body\": \"Always export a backup! Go to Settings → DATA BACKUP and tap EXPORT to save a file. Send it via WhatsApp, email or load it later if you change phone.\"\n      },\n      \"done\": {\n        \"title\": \"🎉 All set!\",\n        \"body\": \"You're ready to start! Remember: you can relaunch this guide anytime from Settings → RESTART GUIDE. Good luck!\"\n      },\n      \"home_stats_box\": {\n        \"title\": \"Stats box at the bottom 📊\",\n        \"body\": \"At the bottom of Home there's a panel with GROSS, NET, PROFIT and COSTS of the day, updated live as you type. It's very important to check each day at a glance. Tap PROFIT to see the breakdown.\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"suppliers\": {\n    \"cash\": \"CONTANTI\",\n    \"invoice\": \"FATTURA\",\n    \"mixed\